70	Division D: Financial/Economic Infrastructure
71	UNTITLED S CORP 4
72	LLC 1: The Peralta Project
73	The Peralta Project is a proof of concept for a financial deficit recovery software developed in-house by the
74	students and staff of the Peralta Community College District. Following the Peralta Community College
75	District’s September 2023 Board of Trustees meetings, The Peralta Project aims to turn the Peralta
76	Community College District's “2% budgetary issue into student homework assignments, exam questions,
77	and tutoring exercises for Laney College’s artificial intelligence and business administration courses. This
78	would allow students to analyze and fix the Peralta Community College District’s budgetary issues while
79	recovering equity with every successful student project.
80	From this project, a proof of concept for the following can be developed:
81	Military-grade economic weaponry systems.
82	Proprietary blockchain ATM hardware/software.
83	decentralized e-banking system for transient citizens (NATO + BRICS).
84	Rouge AI contingency software.
85	Electronic cannabis payment/banking software.
86	The ‘Budtender’ LLM (for online use only)
87	Real-Time Transactional Monitoring System
